```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Cliente
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant AKF as API Key Filter
    participant H as umhub-service
    participant CON as Consul
    participant CORE as tesoreria-core-service

    C->>GW: GET /api/tesoreria/umhub/reservaVacante/reserva/status/{id}
    GW->>AKF: Validar X-API-Key
    alt API Key inválida
        AKF-->>GW: 401 Unauthorized
        GW-->>C: Error de autenticación
    else API Key válida
        AKF->>H: Reenviar solicitud
        H->>CON: Descubrir tesoreria-core-service
        CON-->>H: Dirección del servicio
        H->>CORE: Llamada OpenFeign (getReservaVacanteStatus)
        CORE-->>H: BackendReservaVacanteResponse
        alt Reserva no encontrada
            H-->>GW: 404 Not Found
            GW-->>C: Error: reserva no encontrada
        else Reserva encontrada
            H-->>GW: ReservaVacanteWrappedResponse
            GW-->>C: 200 OK (estado consultado)
        end
    end
